Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc1, libqt5core5a, libqt5gui5, libqt5widgets5, libqt5sql5, libqt5sql5-sqlite, libqt5dbus5
Description: KylinNote desktop notes and tasks
 KylinNote provides desktop notes and task management with local storage.
 It includes note editing, task organization, reminders and a system tray.
